OL,3,GNEWSAI'm a British Photography Award
OL,4,Awinner ` I'm still worried about what
OL,5,Acomes next
OL,6,
OL,7,FAward-winning photographer David
OL,8,FGilliver has built an international
OL,9,Freputation from his playful miniature
OL,10,Fworlds, secured global commercial
OL,11,Fclients and collected some of the
OL,12,Findustry's most prestigious prizes.
OL,14,FDespite being nominated in four
OL,15,Fcategories at this year's British
OL,16,FPhotography Awards - winning one of
OL,17,Fthem - the 47-year-old fears he may not
OL,18,Fbe able to sustain a career behind the
OL,19,Fcamera.
OL,21,FHe said if 2027 is like 2026, he may
OL,22,Fhave to find a part-time job.
